phone-mcp-server (0.3.7-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security fix: add PHONE_READONLY (default true, fail-closed)
    guarding call_number, end_call, send_text_message, create_contact,
    terminate_app, set_alarm, launch_app_activity, and the
    tap/swipe/key/text actions of interact_with_screen -- previously
    none of these had any read-only gate.

